OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 4,000 new homes
OL,4,Asubmitted to councils
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial proposals to build 4,000
OL,7,Fhomes on farmland to the south-east of
OL,8,FLeicester have been lodged with council
OL,9,Fplanners.
OL,11,FUrban and Civic Developments Ltd and
OL,12,FHomes England, the government's housing
OL,13,Fand regeneration agency, want to
OL,14,Fdevelop a 932-acre (377-hectare) area
OL,15,Fbetween Oadby and Great Glen.
OL,17,FDocuments submitted to Harborough
OL,18,FDistrict Council and Oadby and Wigston
OL,19,FBorough Council stated the scheme would
OL,20,Fcreate a sustainable new community to
OL,21,Fhelp meet housing needs in the area.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
